{%- comment -%}
  The national store's home delivery for the current cart, as the checkout will charge it, in agorot; prints nothing
  when the estimate is off. Captured by the cart drawer and the cart page (sections/cart-drawer, sections/main-cart),
  which re-render on every cart change, so the figure follows the cart.

  Shopify's rates (the owner, 24.11.2026: no free shipping any more):
  - every item of the default profile ("General profile"): settings.shipping_rate_regular (39 ₪) once per order. Free
    only if settings.shipping_free_from is set (0 since 24.11.2026: never free); the order is then the whole cart,
    profile items included, as the checkout counted it on 20.11.2026;
  - every other profile ("מוצרים בינוניים" 49 ₪, "מוצרים גדולים" 115 ₪, "טלוויזיות" 115 ₪): its rate from
    settings.shipping_profile_rates (snippets/shipping-profile-rate), once per order for each profile in the cart,
    never free;
  - the rates of every profile in the cart are added (39 + 49 + 115 = 203 ₪ for one item of each of three).
  A profile item is a variant with the metafield shipping.profile (the profile's id), which the dashboard writes whenever
  it moves products into or out of a profile. The shop metafield shipping.marks says the dashboard has marked a
  profile's variants; until then a profile item would look regular and the line would understate the delivery, so
  nothing is printed. Nothing is printed either for an item of a profile the setting does not list.
  The free threshold, when set, is compared with the shipped lines after their discounts and after the whole order's
  discounts: the lowest the checkout can count, so the line never says "free" where the checkout charges.

  Output: an integer (agorot), or nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign se_on = settings.cart_shipping_estimate
  if shop.metafields.shipping.marks == blank
    assign se_on = false
  endif
  if se_on
    assign se_regular = settings.shipping_rate_regular | default: 0 | times: 100 | round
    assign se_free_from = settings.shipping_free_from | default: 0 | times: 100 | round

    assign se_has_regular = false
    assign se_unknown = false
    assign se_profiles = '|'
    assign se_profile_total = 0
    assign se_shipped = 0
    for se_item in cart.items
      if se_item.requires_shipping
        assign se_shipped = se_shipped | plus: se_item.final_line_price
        assign se_profile = se_item.variant.metafields.shipping.profile | strip
        if se_profile != blank
          assign se_key = '|' | append: se_profile | append: '|'
          unless se_profiles contains se_key
            assign se_profiles = se_profiles | append: se_profile | append: '|'
            capture se_rate
              render 'shipping-profile-rate', profile: se_profile
            endcapture
            assign se_rate = se_rate | strip
            if se_rate == blank
              assign se_unknown = true
            else
              assign se_profile_total = se_profile_total | plus: se_rate
            endif
          endunless
        else
          assign se_has_regular = true
        endif
      endif
    endfor

    unless se_unknown
      assign se_order_discounts = 0
      for se_discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications
        assign se_order_discounts = se_order_discounts | plus: se_discount.total_allocated_amount
      endfor
      assign se_basis = se_shipped | minus: se_order_discounts | at_least: 0

      assign se_total = se_profile_total
      if se_has_regular
        if se_free_from == 0 or se_basis < se_free_from
          assign se_total = se_total | plus: se_regular
        endif
      endif
      echo se_total
    endunless
  endif
-%}
